const T2 = "<section class=\"svc-intro mm-intro\"><div class=\"mm-marco\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Custom Pergola Builders Serving <span class=\"mm-rot\">North &amp; South Florida</span></h2><p class=\"mm-p\">Our pergola builders design and install custom aluminum pergolas for North &amp; South Florida homes, combining expert craftsmanship, durable materials, and stylish shade solutions that elevate outdoor living spaces year-round.</p><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/about\">More About Us<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"mm-gal\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\"><span class=\"mm-rot\">Pergola</span> Project Gallery</h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Florida aluminum pergola installations designed for shade, style, and lasting durability.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/gallery\">Project Gallery<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-mosaico mm-mosaico--6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pergolas-10/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-10.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: White aluminum modern insulated pergola installation with bar seating by Florida builders, creating functional and stylish outdoor living.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pergolas-10/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-10.jpg\" alt=\"White aluminum modern insulated pergola installation with bar seating by Florida builders, creating functional and stylish outdoor living.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"839\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pergolas-9/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-09.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Custom pergola installation over backyard deck by Florida contractors, blending landscape design and outdoor structure.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pergolas-9/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-09.jpg\" alt=\"Custom pergola installation over backyard deck by Florida contractors, blending landscape design and outdoor structure.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"976\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pergolas-8/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-08.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Poolside pergola installation in Florida backyard, designed by expert pergola builders for shade and comfort.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pergolas-8/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-08.jpg\" alt=\"Poolside pergola installation in Florida backyard, designed by expert pergola builders for shade and comfort.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"839\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pergolas-7/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-07.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Contemporary pergola construction for residential patio in Florida, built by licensed outdoor living contractors.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pergolas-7/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-07.jpg\" alt=\"Contemporary pergola construction for residential patio in Florida, built by licensed outdoor living contractors.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pergolas-6/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-06.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Aluminum pergola installation over pool area by Florida contractors, providing shade and modern outdoor design.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pergolas-6/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-06.jpg\" alt=\"Aluminum pergola installation over pool area by Florida contractors, providing shade and modern outdoor design.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pergolas-5/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-05.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Timber pavilion installation with outdoor kitchen by Florida builders, combining pergola structure and entertainment space.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pergolas-5/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-05.jpg\" alt=\"Timber pavilion installation with outdoor kitchen by Florida builders, combining pergola structure and entertainment space.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><script type=\"application/json\" class=\"mm-gal-mas\">[{\"url\":\"/images/images/pergolas-4/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-04.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Custom wood pavilion construction by Florida pergola contractors, showcasing exposed beams and premium craftsmanship.\"},{\"url\":\"/images/images/pergolas-3/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-03.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Backyard pergola and patio cover installation in Florida home, designed by professional outdoor living builders.\"},{\"url\":\"/images/images/pergolas-2/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-02.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Modern aluminum pergola installed beside pool by Florida contractors, featuring clean lines and durable outdoor construction.\"},{\"url\":\"/images/images/pergolas-1/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-01.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Custom aluminum patio cover installation by Florida pergola builders, providing shaded outdoor living space with modern structure.\"}]</script></section><section class=\"mm-proc\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Custom Pergola <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our pergola builders guide you from design to final installation, managing permits and codes for seamless projects across North &amp; South Florida.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-proc-medio\" data-mm-pasos-medio=\"\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-107/insulated-patio-cover-black-frame-new-pavers-install-florida-proceso0.avif\" alt=\"New black-framed insulated patio cover on a white house with marble pavers still being laid\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 45%\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"01 / 04\" data-t=\"Pergola Type &amp; Style Selection\"></div></figure><ol class=\"mm-pasos\" data-mm-pasos=\"\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-107/insulated-patio-cover-black-frame-new-pavers-install-florida-proceso0.avif\" alt=\"New black-framed insulated patio cover on a white house with marble pavers still being laid\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 45%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Pergola Type &amp; Style Selection</h3><p>Consultation on pergola categories (louvered, covered, open, clear) with wind-load engineering assessment per ASCE 7-22 structural standards. We review each style's benefits for sun control, durability, and architectural integration.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/suelta/modern-patio-cover-black-frame-slat-walls-install-florida-proceso1.avif\" alt=\"Black-framed flat patio cover with slatted walls and blue marble-look panels being installed over a sports court\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Customization Design &amp; 3D Rendering</h3><p>Design of custom dimensions, material finishes (marine-grade stainless steel hardware), automation options (motorized louvers), and integration with existing structures. Full 3D visualization provided.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-002/aluminum-pergola-frame-installation-crew-ladders-florida-proceso2.avif\" alt=\"Crew on ladders assembling a black aluminum pergola frame over a travertine patio.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 45%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Structural Engineering &amp; Permitting</h3><p>Structural design verification by licensed engineers, permit acquisition including wind-load certifications, and ARB submissions if required. HVHZ compliance certification for coastal properties.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-061/insulated-patio-cover-ceiling-bronze-frame-florida-proceso3.avif\" alt=\"Underside of an insulated aluminum patio cover with bronze beams, installer on a ladder.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Installation &amp; System Integration</h3><p>Professional installation with foundation work, structural alignment verification, motorization testing (if applicable), and integration with smart home systems for seamless operation.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"mm-que\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Custom Aluminum Pergola Design &amp; Building in Florida</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We design and build custom aluminum pergolas for Florida homes, delivering shade, durability, and elevated outdoor living.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Designed For Homes &amp; Businesses</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Every pergola starts from the space it has to cover. We set column positions, beam depth and rafter spacing around your patio dimensions, door swings and sightlines, whether the structure shades a backyard in Gainesville or a restaurant terrace in Fort Lauderdale.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Custom Pergola Design</dt><dd>Custom pergola designs tailored to your outdoor space, architecture, and functional needs.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Residential &amp; Commercial Pergolas</dt><dd>Pergola solutions designed for residential homes and commercial outdoor environments.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo mm-grupo--activo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Aluminum &amp; Treated Wood</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Aluminum handles most of what we build here: it will not rot, swell or feed termites, and a powder-coated finish stands up to salt air and Florida UV. When a client wants wood grain overhead, we frame in treated lumber and detail the connections to shed water.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Aluminum Pergola Construction</dt><dd>Durable aluminum pergolas built for low maintenance and long-term performance in Florida climates.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Pergola Construction</dt><dd>Custom pergolas crafted with treated materials for natural beauty and structural reliability.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Standalone Structures &amp; Roofline Extensions</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">A freestanding pergola sits on its own footings, anchored against uplift, so it can stand out by the pool or in the middle of the yard. An attached one carries a ledger into the wall framing, and we flash that joint so the roofline extension does not trap water.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Freestanding Pergolas</dt><dd>Freestanding pergola structures ideal for pools, gardens, and open outdoor living areas.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Attached Pergolas</dt><dd>Attached pergolas designed to seamlessly extend patios and covered outdoor spaces.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Louvered Roofs &amp; Night Lighting</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Louvered roofs rotate from open sky to a closed, water-shedding ceiling, so an afternoon storm does not clear the patio. We run wiring through the beams and columns for wet-rated downlights and fan boxes, which keeps conduit off the finished surfaces and the space usable after dark.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Louvered &amp; Adjustable Pergolas</dt><dd>Adjustable pergola systems offering flexible shade control and enhanced outdoor comfort.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Pergola Lighting Integration</dt><dd>Integrated lighting solutions that improve functionality, ambiance, and nighttime usability.</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-que-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/images/pergolas-9/custom-pergola-patio-cover-builders-florida-09.jpg\" alt=\"White attached pergola over the patio of a tile-roof Florida home\" width=\"1250\" height=\"976\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"02 / 04\" data-t=\"Aluminum &amp; Treated Wood\"></div></figure></div></section>";
const T4 = "<section class=\"mm-faq\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Pergola Installation <span class=\"mm-rot\">FAQs</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Have questions about custom aluminum pergola installation in Florida? Our licensed outdoor living specialists answer the top questions here.</p></div></div><div class=\"mm-faq-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-faq-lista\"><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Are aluminum pergolas rust-proof for Florida outdoor use?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Powder-coated aluminum pergolas resist rust, corrosion, and UV damage — making them ideal for Florida's humid, salt-air coastal environments and sun-intense inland climates. Licensed under aluminum contractor license SCC131153553, Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living engineers every structure to local wind-load specifications.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Are aluminum pergolas better than wood in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Aluminum outperforms wood in Florida's demanding climate. Powder-coated aluminum resists rust, rot, insect damage, and UV fading without seasonal staining or resealing. Unlike wood, aluminum maintains its structural integrity in coastal humidity, salt air, and intense heat — delivering decades of reliable performance with minimal upkeep.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How long does pergola installation take in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Most custom pergola installations are completed in one to three days once permits are approved and materials are fabricated. Timelines vary based on structural complexity and HOA review requirements. Our licensed team coordinates engineering, fabrication, and final inspection to ensure your Florida project stays on schedule.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Can a pergola reduce home cooling costs in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. A strategically positioned pergola creates significant shade over windows, sliding doors, and patio areas — reducing solar heat gain on your Florida home. By limiting the sun's impact on glass and exterior walls, a well-placed pergola can help reduce air-conditioning use during South Florida's intense summer months.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Are permits required for outdoor projects in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Our pergola builders manage the complete permit process and ensure every installation meets Florida building codes and HOA or ARB design requirements. Licensed under SCC131153553, Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living coordinates all inspections and approvals — so your project proceeds without delays and is structurally certified upon completion.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"mm-faq-lado\"><figure class=\